    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：迪姐/小迪/东东</span></p><span></span><p><span>是谁血脉觉醒想去农村自建房种地？</span></p><span></span><p><span>是谁想要成为布达拉宫上空的小鸟？</span></p><span></span><p><span>是谁这一生放荡不羁爱自由？</span></p><span></span><p><span>是谁想在小城镇当一个出租车司机？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是新年特辑节目，具体内容如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a>）普鲁斯特问卷简介</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a>）1、What is your idea of perfect happiness?你心目中的完美幸福是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a>）2、What is your greatest fear?你的最大恐惧是？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">03:58</a>）3、What is the trait you most deplore in yourself?你最不喜欢自己哪个性格特点？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">06:52</a>）4、What is the trait you most deplore in others?你最不喜欢他/她人哪个性格特点？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="512">08:32</a>）5、Which living person do you most admire?你最倾佩的还在世的人是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="607">10:07</a>）6、What is your greatest extravagance?什么是你最大的奢侈？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a>）、What is your current state of mind?你当前的思想状态？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a>）8、What do you consider the most overrated virtue?（什么是你认为被过度重视的品格？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="965">16:05</a>）9、On what occasion do you lie?什么场合你会撒谎？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a>）10、What do you most dislike about your appearance?你最不喜欢自己外表的哪方面？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1143">19:03</a>）11、Which living person do you most despise?你最厌恶/鄙视的还在世的人是？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a>）12、What is the quality you most like in a man?你最喜欢男士身上的哪种特质？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a>）13、What is the quality you most like in a woman?你最喜欢女士身上的哪种特质？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">21:01</a>）14、Which words or phrases do you most overuse?哪些词你会过度使用？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a>）15、What or who is the greatest love of your life?你生命的挚爱是谁/什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1388">23:08</a>）16、When and where were you happiest?你最开心的时刻和地点是？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">24:41</a>）17、Which talent would you most like to have?你最希望自己拥有的禀赋是？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1611">26:51</a>）18、If you could change one thing about yourself, what would it be?如果你可以改变自己的某一个方面，会是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1647">27:27</a>）19、What do you consider your greatest achievement?你认为你迄今为止最大的成就是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1694">28:14</a>）20、If you were to die and come back as a person or a thing,what would it be?如果来世变成一个人或物，你希望是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1775">29:35</a>）21、Where would you most like to live?你最希望在哪里生活？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1861">31:01</a>）22、What is your most treasured possession?你最珍爱的收藏是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a>）23、What do you regard as the lowest depth of misery?什么是你认为最低程度的痛苦？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2001">33:21</a>）24、What is your favorite occupation?你最喜欢的职业是？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2124">35:24</a>）25、What is your most marked characteristic?你最突出的性格特点是？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2172">36:12</a>）26、What do you most value in your friends?你最欣赏朋友什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2215">36:55</a>）27、Who are your favorite writers?谁是你最喜欢的作家/们？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2304">38:24</a>）28、Who is your hero of fiction?虚构作品里，你心目中的英雄？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2381">39:41</a>）29、Which historical figure do you most identify with?你觉得自己和哪个历史人物很像？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2407">40:07</a>）30、Who are your heroes in real life?真实生活里，谁是你的英雄/们？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a>）31、What are your favorite names?你最喜欢的名字/们？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2547">42:27</a>）32、What is it that you most dislike?你最不喜欢的是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2598">43:18</a>）33、What is your greatest regret?你最大的遗憾是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2659">44:19</a>）34、How would you like to die?你希望如何死去？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2709">45:09</a>）35、What is your motto?你的箴言/座右铭是？</span></p><span></span><p><span>（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2772">46:12</a>）做完问卷后的感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家和我们一起讨论交流问卷内容，在评论区或者自己在备忘录记录下自己的答案，祝大家新年快乐~</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐来自www.fiftysounds.com/zh/</span></p>]]></description>
